  "description": "***UNFURNISHED 3 BED HOUSE TO LET*** Updated photos to follow.\n\nIRES are delighted to present this spacious 3 bedroom house in Coldcut Park. The Property Comprises of large open plan kitchen and lounge, 3 good size double bedrooms and 3 bathrooms. The property has a back garden and comes with parking. \n\nColdcut Park is situated in Clondalkin, Dublin 22 which is an established residential development just 9km west of Dublin City Centre.\n\nFeatures: - Extensive local amenities and leisure facilities including Liffey Valley Shopping Centre. - Good transport links in and out of the City Centre and conveniently close to the M50, M4, M7 and other road networks. \nProperty Features: - Dedicated Property Manager - Full time maintenance team (office hours) and emergency 24-hour maintenance service - Bright and spacious with fully fitted kitchens and bathrooms - Monitored CCTV security systems throughout - High energy efficiency gas fired central heating - Painted timber framed double glazed windows and doors Facilities: Parking Central Heating / Cable Television / Washing Machine / Dishwasher / Microwave Internet Garden / Patio / Balcony. Prospect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the Contact form is processed by IRES Fund Management Limited according to applicable laws and our privacy statement http://www.iresfund.ie/privacy-policy/ and may involve data transfer outside the EEA. Please note a direct debit for rental payment must be set up.",
